      { axis: "who holds the seed" visit: "a seed per page load, so the paper shifts between visits" book: "a seed from chapter number, stone date and binding, so two readers in one binding hold the same sheet and a new stone grows a new one" now: "phase 28 requires a seed and does not say whose" }
      { axis: "progressive or Houdini-first" progressive: "the SVG grain is the floor every engine gets, and paint() a richer sheet where it exists (adopt-with-fallbacks)" houdini_first: "the worklet is the look and plain paper the declared floor, written in the ledger (lore-c008)" now: "progressive (resolved_direction_2026_07_16)" }
